{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_1630624872#0_3627264914","relevance":3,"reason":"Council on Foreign Relations backgrounder is dedicated to media/internet censorship in China and directly supports how extensively the Chinese government censors citizens via firewalls, monitoring, shutdowns, and jailing journalists/bloggers/activists.","learned":"China maintains tight control over traditional and new media using monitoring systems, the Great Firewall, shuttering sites/publications, and imprisoning journalists, bloggers, and activists."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q580","reason":"The initial direct query produced a strong grade-3 source; continue while the ranking is likely to surface more dedicated evidence."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q580"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_58_735327732#0_1027950557","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q580","rank":2,"snippet":"735327732#0_1027950557\" , \"end_char\": 1082.000000 , \"headings\": \"The Great Firewall of China The Great Firewall of China \\\"Information industries of China unite!\\\" Deus Ex Machina Spiritual pollution control Just Sign Here The Ecstasy of Communication Shanghai Style Brave New Net Money talks The Great NetWall Judgment Day Roads Ahead Dark Guests Financial jitters \" , \"segment\": \"The Great Firewall of China | WIRED Geremie R. Barm e Sang Y e 06.01.1997 12:00 PM The Great Firewall of <cover>China At ISPs, Internet cafés, even state censorship </cover>committees, we meet the wired of China – and discover that the technology China needs to build the most powerful country on Earth in the 21st Century threatens to undermine the institutions that rule the nation. And Beijing's control freaks are worried. \" Information industries of China unite!\" Xia […] Facebook Twitter Email Save Story Save this story for later. At ISPs, Internet cafés, even state censorship committees, we meet the wired of China - and discover that the technology China needs to build the most powerful country on Earth in the 21st Century threatens to undermine the institutions "}}
