{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_629400680#6_1383242867","relevance":3,"reason":"BBC's China media profile is dedicated to China's media environment and gives direct evidence of extensive state censorship: the Great Firewall blocks tens of thousands of sites through URL filtering and keyword censoring, thousands of cyber-police monitor politically/socially sensitive material, and major platforms and human-rights sites are blocked.","learned":"China's Great Firewall blocks tens of thousands of sites, including Facebook, Twitter, YouTube, and human-rights sites; thousands of cyber-police monitor the web and filter politically/socially sensitive material, while VPN circumvention has been restricted."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q601","reason":"This query is retrieving strong overview evidence about the scale and mechanisms of Chinese internet censorship; continue to gather more grade-3 sources."}}
