{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ china chinese) (+ \"great firewall\" \"golden shield\") (+ \"deep packet inspection\" \"keyword filtering\" \"website blocking\") (+ censorship surveillance))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_55_791815649#7_1791396092","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q613","rank":2,"snippet":"blacklisted VPN to reliably bypass China’s Great Firewall it now needs to offer three essential features: Why Should You Use a VPN in China? 1 To Circumvent Chinese Censorship 2 To Protect Yourself from Surveillance Is It Legal to Use a VPN in China? The Best Alternatives to Freedome VPN Astrill ExpressVPN VPN.ac F-Secure Freedome & China FAQs Is F-Secure Freedome VPN Safe? What Is the Best VPN for China? About the Author \" , \"segment\": \"Obfuscation Technology Simply having unbreakable encryption is no longer sufficient to circumvent <cover>Chinese censorship. The Great Firewall uses deep packet inspection (</cover>DPI) techniques to analyze browsing traffic and hunt for internet connections that are routed through a VPN server. The system doesn’t need to decrypt your traffic or understand its contents to identify it. Instead, it simply uses DPI to identify common patterns in VPN traffic and block it accordingly. To work in China, a VPN needs to use obfuscation technology. Effective obfuscation camouflages your VPN traffic to make it appear like regular HTTPS traffic, making it much harder for authorities to locate and block it. Normal VPN encryption prevents observers from reading your traffic, while ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_44_518686996#1_1229847895","rank":1,"relevance":2}]}}
